        exam: [.direct("What did you see on {DATE}?", "\"{D} fled from deputies at 120 mph on a county road for nine miles. There were two children in the back seat.\""), .direct("How did the chase end?", "\"The car ended in a ditch. Thankfully, the children were not seriously hurt. It could have been much worse.\""), .direct("What does the hospital record show?", "\"There was no emergency visit. {D.He} said it was for a child, but there is no record of one.\""), .direct("What did you see at 8 p.m.?", "\"I attempted a stop for speeding on a county road. The driver accelerated away and reached about 120 mph within a minute while my lights and siren were on.\""), .direct("How did the chase unfold?", "\"Nine miles of curves and straightaways. The car crossed the center line several times and nearly struck an oncoming truck before running off the road.\""), .direct("What did you find when you reached the car?", "\"Two children in the back, both crying and belted. {DL} was in the driver's seat with a swollen lip, and the car was nose down in a ditch.\""), .cross("{DL} says {D.he} was rushing a child to a hospital, doesn't {D.he}?", "\"I can't say it's untrue. I can say a hospital had no record.\""), .cross("Did you see any sign of illness in the children?", "\"They were scared, not sick as far as I could tell. I'm not a doctor.\""), .cross("Why did you pursue the car?", "\"{D.He} wouldn't stop for the lights. A fleeing vehicle at that speed is a danger to everyone.\""), .cross("Did {D} say anything about a hospital?", "\"Yes, at the car, {D.he} said a child had a fever and was being rushed to the hospital.\""), .cross("Did you check the children for injury?", "\"Yes. A medic confirmed bruises from the crash and shock, but no serious injuries.\"")],
