        openings: ("{D}, with six prior DWI convictions, was found beside a rolled truck at about 1 a.m., holding the keys, with a .16 breath result. The trooper found no one else at the scene.", "The defense witnesses will explain that someone else drove, that the person left after the crash, and that {D} simply picked up the keys."),
        closings: ("A rolled truck, the keys in {D}'s pocket, a .16 reading, and six earlier convictions. No one else was there, and {D} was the driver.", "A friend who drove and left the scene, and a person who picked up the keys. The State must prove {D} was driving, and being found beside a truck is not driving."),
        timeline: [(0, "1 a.m.: the crash."), (0, "1:20 a.m.: the trooper."), (0, "2 a.m.: the test."), (1, "{DL} is charged.")],
