        openings: ("Deputies found forty dogs in stacked crates with empty water bowls in a barn owned by {D}. Six were dying, twenty-two were dehydrated, and {D} had advertised puppies that very week.", "Weigh the defense proof, which will show that a helper fed the dogs daily until quitting three days earlier, and that {D} did not know how bad things had become."),
