        openings: ("A bouncer, {V}, ejected {D} from a bar. An hour later {D} returned with a pistol, and {V} was shot at closing. The bullet matches {D}'s pistol. The State will present the bartender and the camera.", "Jurors will also see a patron who saw {V} reach toward {V.his} belt in the dark, and a shot fired in a second of fear."),
