        exam: [.direct("What did your investigation find about the overlook shooting?", "\"{V}, a club member, was shot from an overlook on {DATE}. Texts planned the ambush.\""), .direct("What do the texts say?", "\"One says, 'Be at the overlook at 6.' It sets the time and place.\""), .direct("What was found in {DL}'s truck?", "\"Matching shotgun shells. {D} was also seen with a shotgun, and the autopsy found a shotgun wound.\""), .direct("How did the ambush develop based on your investigation?", "\"A text on a phone tied to the club's members said to be at the overlook at 6 p.m. {V} went there and was shot with a shotgun from higher ground.\""), .direct("What did you find at the overlook?", "\"Fresh shell casings in the brush above the road, a boot print in the dirt, and a spot where someone had knelt. We recovered two spent shells.\""), .direct("What did your search of {D}'s truck turn up?", "\"Shotgun shells of the same gauge and brand as the casings, and a shotgun in a case behind the seat.\""), .cross("{DL} says {D.he} was hunting, doesn't {D.he}?", "\"People do hunt near overlooks. But the texts plan an ambush.\""), .cross("Who sent the texts?", "\"I'm still working on that. I can't say they came from {DL}.\""), .cross("Is the shell type common?", "\"Yes. It's a common type. A match is not unique.\""), .cross("Do you know who sent the text?", "\"We are still tracing the number. It came from a prepaid phone, and I cannot yet say it was {DL}'s.\""), .cross("Was hunting allowed in that area?", "\"Parts of the county allow it in season. That specific overlook is close to a public road, so hunting there would be unusual.\"")],
